IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User bugsdevelops@gmail.com
PassCmd "gpg --quiet --decrypt ~/.local/share/tokens/emacs-mail.gpg"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/Gmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/Gmail/Inbox

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Near
Expunge None
SyncState *
